    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "EBF1DD29191CA66F",
      "text": "這裡的空調\\n果然還是太冷了吧？\\r\\n我該去找誰才能調高溫度？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
