    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "EBF1DC29191CA4BC",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)]的狀況很好，\\n和我的寶可夢相處得很融洽。\\r\\n……現在看來可沒有冷場喔。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
